Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(至今走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得发誓不会想方设法救我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to promise not to try to bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是猎魔人  现在你弟弟又出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter. Now you know your brother's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  他有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam. He's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的灵魂  不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在去地狱带回你弟弟的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go to hell to fetch your brother's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啥都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到炼狱对我而言才是重中之重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding purgatory's important to me --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个满是灵魂却未被开发过的油井\N{\fnArial\fs30}An untapped oil well of every fanged,clawed soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们清楚灵魂有多珍贵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what souls are worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们有什么力量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What power they hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:00:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔和他的追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael and his followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想让他去统治天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want him to rule heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:04.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最不想看到的  就是他掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we want is to let him take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小英国佬数月前被烧得灰飞烟灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little limey mook roasted months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.85,0:01:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我想来谈笔简单的交易  -跟我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to discuss a simple business transaction. - With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你勾结了克劳力合伙找炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}U and crowley have been going after purgatory together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能阻止拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can stop Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(交货入口)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就  就一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just,uh -- just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  伙计  我们中午才营业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,pal. We -- we open at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我想我非常明白是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I-I think I understand...just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想惹麻烦  说真的  你赶紧走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I don't need this kind of hassle, so, seriously, just get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  给我一分钟让我想想办法就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, just give me a minute to think, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后绝不打扰你  就一分钟  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm out of your hair. One minute, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.81,0:02:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:55.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得了  什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I don't remember. I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第6季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  你少跟我扯蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're dickin' with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都忘了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了  一片空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you -- blank slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总有钱包  身份证吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you got a wallet, I.D.?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你最后记得的事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what's the last thing you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在公园的长椅上醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up on a park bench, 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察的手电在我脸上晃  他们想抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}cops shoving a flashlight in my face, trying to take me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我  我把他们撂倒了  俩个都撂倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I, um I knocked them out cold, both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我也不想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look. I didn't mean to. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是发生的太快了  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just happened really fast, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我觉得那是本能什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think I-instinct or something, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这本能挺给力啊  -对  可不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's some instinct. - Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正常人谁会有这种身手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who even knows how to do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先带你去急诊室  那些个医生们会治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you to the E.R. the --the quacks will hash it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try "Yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样相当不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the bats have flown the belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你需要看医生  -不  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to see a doctor. - No,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你急着要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很难道明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得  我必须得赶去什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel like I-I have to...be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须得阻止什么事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's s-something I got to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼吗  还是赶火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, like a wedding? A train?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  很重要的事  是事关生死  事关...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, something important, something like...life or death,like-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白  好啦  放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30} OK!-- hey,hey,hey. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:29.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逼是逼不出来的  所以  不如顺其自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you can't poop it out. So, just -- it'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(H. P.洛夫克拉夫特  《猎黑行者》)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是恐怖小说迷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a horror fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:56.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,um,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  真有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I really think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.18,0:05:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西有点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something -- something about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.85,0:05:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利浦不是他的姓  是洛夫克萊夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phillips ain't his last name. It's Lovecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你该去医院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,we are taking you to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有电脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.27,0:05:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是它  存在的  两个镇之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. It exists. Look -- two towns over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你认为自己住在这破地方么  -也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think you're staying in this dump? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你是个鸭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're a hooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  我不知道该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,um... I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你做的这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything.Y,uh-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚还突然犯病了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the head case that just slumped over a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么说你才会去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,is there any way I can convince you to go to a hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不去了  显然我是个固执的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Apparently,I'm stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你的好意  但是不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,that's really nice of you but not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗  你脑子很不清醒  -但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? Okay,look,your eggs are scrambled. - But --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.07,0:05:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我是说  我是个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I mean,I'm -- I'm just some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可能是个坏人  你一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I could be anybody. You got to be nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话别人对我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been called that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果让你自己走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,if I let you go off alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会夜不能寐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be able to sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我很想知道真相如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,honestly,I'm dying to know how it all turns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  从哪开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,uh,where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一层  拐角房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,ground floor,corner room...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最接近逃生口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearest to the fire escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的话就选那间房  逃跑最方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one I'd pick -- quickest getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.18,0:06:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有信用卡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,you got a credit card?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛  我们要入住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Are we,uh,checking in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This all yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:27.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你这里的装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I love what you've done with the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点《美丽心灵》加《七宗罪》的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very "Beautiful mind" Meets..."se7en."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  我一紧张就乱说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I talk when I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们知道你叫什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,well,I guess we know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你  吉米·佩奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you,Jimmy page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  尼尔·佩尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,uh,Neil peart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  安格斯·杨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Angus young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  请别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,listen,no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我有点被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm...really starting to freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.01,0:07:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说在这里等她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said to meet her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再打给她试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看来我还是需要你帮忙  -别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess I could have used your help after all. - Just be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么回事  -他们抓走了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - They took me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,what have they done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔我还能对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon I could have handled,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是当天使一出面...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when the angel stepped in...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him,Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:09:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经做好打开炼狱的准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have enough to crack purgatory wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我吧  我得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要处女的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need virgin blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对他们来说是小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a milk run for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还需要炼狱生物的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they need the blood of a purgatory native.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也已经搞到很多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they've got plenty of that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经把门打开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have they opened it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要等到月蚀才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moon and the eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  没关系的  -我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's okay. - I'm sorry, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们他们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对此事深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry this had to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力丧心病狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道跟你一点关系都没有么  你个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet it was all Crowley, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没醒悟  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even see it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道自己已经完全失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How totally off the rails you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎你对我的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经向你解释过了  但你却听不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to make you understand. You won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我不妨直说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me make this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你回家吧  让我来阻止拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go home and let me stop Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话我不会说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  因为我想你已经猜到答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good, 'cause I think you already know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望事情没有发展到这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it hadn't come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点你可以放心  等这一切结束以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, rest assured, when this is all over...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会救萨姆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will save Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但前提是你不能插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only if you stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.87,0:10:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要救萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save Sam from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  喂  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你都记起了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:50.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种话说出来会显得很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might sound pretty strange if I said it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能比现在更奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,it -- it couldn't get any stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  别过早下结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为只是些零碎的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's all pretty spotty, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只记得我当时...我和...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just remember I was -- I was with, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个男人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}with two guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个有男模的范儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}One was, like, a male-model type,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.39,0:11:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而另一个是个老头  叫做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other was an older guy named, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, what are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了  鲍比·辛格  就是他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Bobby singer. That has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面有他的电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  只有个地址  南达科他州苏瀑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just an address. Sioux Falls, South Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南达科他州\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-listen, Sam --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是叫萨姆吧  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉  但我要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm really sorry, but this is -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就此跟你道别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is where I got to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不必道歉  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Of course. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  那你打算怎么过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, how are you gonna get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我可以开车过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll take my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆就是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你确定吗  -相当确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.07,0:12:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你就这样离开不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel right about you going off like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为我做得已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you've done way too much for me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.14,0:12:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I mean is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有种不详的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a bad feeling, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到你的那些假身份证和那个阴暗的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}With those I.D.s and that shady-ass hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你到底在寻找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're looking for --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:28.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终的结果可能十分不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not like what you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我难道还有别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以在这里多待一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could stick around here a little bit longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等头脑清醒了再决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your head straight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是草率地离开  盲目地...\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of going off, flying blind into --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:42.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  醒过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.19,0:13:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能这样坐视不理  鲍比  我得帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just sit here, Bobby. I've got to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -让他逃离梦境什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - You know, "Dreamscape" his noggin, something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道小卡做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what Cass did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟脑子里那道屏障没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dam inside your brother's head is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:43.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有地狱的记忆都倾巢而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all hell's spilling loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不知道里面什么情况  -我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know what's going on inside. - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们必须得做点什么  -我们会做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have got to do something! - And we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在离他们打开炼狱之门只剩十六小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now we got 16 hours till they pop purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已经少了一个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再失去另一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't afford to be down two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  那事我们有什么进展呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and how's that going,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道克劳力在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got no line on Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道小卡在哪  巴尔萨泽也玩失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no line on Cass. Balthazar's M.I.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, all we've got
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆莫名其妙就昏迷不醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Sam going through whatever the hell this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡要的就是这种效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}...this is exactly what Cass wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to fall to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想萨姆会想要我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try to think of what Sam would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到小卡  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Cass, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闻到威士忌的味道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you smell whiskey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  萨姆  能不能专心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sam, would you focus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  刚才是谁冲我们开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, who shot at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没看清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't really get a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  只要我们能找到我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Look, if we can just get to my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can help us, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道他们是不是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you don't know if they're your friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-调头吧  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just turn around. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你跟我在一起更安全  -你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, you're safer with me. - How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神马  不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才干嘛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啥意思  现在是白天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? It's daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚还是晚上呢  现在是白天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was night, and now it's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.09,0:15:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是白天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不不不  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. No,it wasn't. It...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  今天真是疯够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so I am all filled up on crazy for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  萨姆  再见了您\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Sam? I'll-I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等  嘿  嘿  嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就这么挫的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I really that gawky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  小哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错  再想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold. Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  这是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, I'm hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你看  一般来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But see, normally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,产生幻觉的时候  你至少还是醒着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're awake when you're tripping balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在做梦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚有人赢了主场比赛哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone just won a copy of the home game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在你的脑子里呢  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're inside your grapefruit, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  你被施咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son... you've been juiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的闺蜜小卡把地狱屏障弄倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your B.F.F. Cass brought the hell wall tumbling down,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:18:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你呢  你个可悲的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you, pathetic infant that you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就零落成碎片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}shattered into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是其中一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece...piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会明白呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么废柴  哪像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're jello, pal, unlike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是无缺陷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not handicapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有那劳什子的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saddled with a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上呢  这副肉身我使唤了一阵呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I used to skipper this meatboat for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都得心应手  我敏锐而且坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was smooth sailing. I was sharp, strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.31,0:18:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来他们就把灵魂给你装回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, till they crammed your soul back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看看你现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是以前那副双眼迷蒙没骨气的狗狗样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same misty-eyed milksop you always were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为灵魂本就脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because souls are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯粹是种负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢  不是我恨你  不过话得说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, nothing personal, but run the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在事情不可挽救之前  总得有人掌控局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to take charge around here before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来  出来呀  你躲到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你见了另一个就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you meet the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy! Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起了我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年来我做过的每一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I did this past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想起了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开  不然我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away,  or the girl dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这回你没筹码了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes your leverage
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说过  让你回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I tell you to turn back, 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会喜欢你找到的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you wouldn't like what you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会加倍遗憾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as sorry as you're gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看是谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what the cat dragged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你这老帽把天使防护咒弄对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,  at least you mudfish finally got the angel-proofing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡美人怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's sleeping beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没偷吻人家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't steal any kisses,  I trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久你到底搞什么去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.61,0:22:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要听实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was having second thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-犹豫什么  -犹豫要不要帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About? - About whether to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想我或许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我或许应该反过来把你们收拾掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I should rip out your sticky bits instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你的决定是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡和克劳力在这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass and Crowley are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好戏就在那里开场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the show gets started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  拿上东西你带我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,  well,  give us a minute to pack up and then zap us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.37,0:22:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不不  我可不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,  no,  no,  no,  no. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-巴尔萨泽  -我这是在背叛朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Balthazar. - I'm betraying a friend here...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位非常强大的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very powerful friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想  我冒的风险已经够大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think I've stuck my neck out far enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.49,0:23:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.55,0:23:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  您的炼狱能量奶昔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Purgatory power shake,  monsieur...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半恶鬼  一半处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half monster,  half virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.49,0:23:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今天看起来比平时还纠结\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem even more constipated than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要来点儿润肠的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe get you some colon blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.37,0:23:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要与你重议合作条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm renegotiating our terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊  你有何提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so? What terms do you propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都得不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.33,0:23:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个灵魂也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one single soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.49,0:23:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.28,0:23:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有点儿不平等\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems a bit... unfairly weighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.02,0:23:56.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  你怎么敢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel... you wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.98,0:23:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我向你提议这个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.47,0:24:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我会将那样强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm handing all that power...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.08,0:24:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拱手让给地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the king of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我既不愚蠢也不邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm neither stupid nor wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.99,0:24:10.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.28,0:24:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道忘了你才是下面那个么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten that you're the bottom in this relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有这些选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here are your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.41,0:24:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么滚蛋  要么死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either flee, or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有约定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.43,0:24:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不会像这样毁约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even I don't break contracts like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flee...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  这世道还能相信谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you can't trust anyone these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.71,0:25:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.85,0:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.58,0:25:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.41,0:25:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.97,0:25:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.72,0:25:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.67,0:25:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是记得地狱的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one that remembers hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.25,0:26:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's up, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.01,0:26:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.19,0:26:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们要去的地方  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this is where we're gonna be, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别再偷懒了  赶紧起来和我们汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you get your lazy ass out of bed and come meet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.48,0:26:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你没有来  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you hadn't come, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不  来都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to. I'm here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.23,0:26:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在真实世界里  我在鲍比家  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there in the real world, I'm at Bobby's, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.42,0:26:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直只能闻到老香料和威士忌的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole time, I smell nothing but old spice and whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.84,0:27:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想如果我能回到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured if I could get back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.45,0:27:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到我的身体  我就能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to my body, I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.15,0:27:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.65,0:27:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许莫名就能醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could snap out of it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.42,0:27:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你得先过我这一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.53,0:27:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要醒来  就先要拼凑起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humpty-dumpty has to put himself back together again
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.47,0:27:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个完整的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he can wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.27,0:27:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我是最后一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the last piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.21,0:27:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.77,0:27:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道你所知道的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I have to know what you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.29,0:27:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在牢笼里所发生的事  -相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...what happened in the cage. - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.84,0:27:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.87,0:27:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我还是得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.81,0:27:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  那是你无法想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam... you can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.54,0:27:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再继续了  回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here, go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找那个酒保  去找杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}find that bartender, go find Jess,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:27:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不够坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.06,0:28:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.69,0:28:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这对你来说那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.80,0:28:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.74,0:28:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.47,0:28:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会把我哥哥一个人丢在真实世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving my brother alone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会和你动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.64,0:28:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是你最后的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.61,0:28:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.18,0:29:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你召唤我吗  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rang, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.37,0:29:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特正在来这的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester is on his way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.24,0:29:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  他怎么知道我们在这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Oh. How'd he even know where we were?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.15,0:29:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然...我们中间有个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently... we have a Judas in our midst.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.40,0:29:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.79,0:29:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是那个可恶的小天使  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet it's that bloody little Cherub, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.23,0:29:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.27,0:29:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我想让你去查出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I need you to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.49,0:29:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  马上去  马上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Um, right away, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.00,0:29:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我怎么处理迪恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but what do you want me to do about Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.26,0:30:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己处理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.78,0:30:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.54,0:30:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.00,0:30:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先是萨姆和迪恩  现在是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Sam and Dean, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不可能的情况下我已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing my best in impossible circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.11,0:30:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends -- they...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.04,0:30:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}abandon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.88,0:30:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,密谋反对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}plot against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.04,0:30:31.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人十分费解\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's difficult to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.48,0:30:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是一直在你身边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you -- you always got little old me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.79,0:30:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  你总是陪着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'll always have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.95,0:30:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.22,0:31:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到有十几个  可能还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count a dozen mooks, probably more.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.66,0:31:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.36,0:31:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.40,0:31:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么对付那么多天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how the hell are we gonna take out that many angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.75,0:31:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  我们悄悄潜入\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't. We'll ninja our way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.59,0:31:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赞个  直到他们听到你膝盖嘎吱响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome, yeah -- till they hear your knee squeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.63,0:31:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.63,0:31:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你现在脸皮薄了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what, now you got thin skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.85,0:31:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.97,0:31:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.21,0:31:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霸王龙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}T. Rex, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.90,0:32:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy mother of...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.35,0:32:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车  上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the car. Get to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不要低估了地狱之王  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never underestimate the king of hell, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.12,0:32:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂很多顶级的小把戏哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a lot of swell tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.76,0:32:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我们可以重新谈判了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I think it's time to re-renegotiate our terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.27,0:33:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  手心都是汗哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweaty hands, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.31,0:33:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.77,0:33:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以随便抚摸我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can palm me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.35,0:33:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在我新搭档的庇佑下很安全  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm safe and sound under the wing of my new partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.47,0:33:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.81,0:33:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和恶魔合作  你自降身份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consorting with demons. I thought that was beneath you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.26,0:33:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你也有合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you were doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.11,0:33:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来颇有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounded like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.36,0:33:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的拉斐尔各种\N{\fnArial\fs30}y-you said all sorts of shameful,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.62,0:33:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可耻可怕下流的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}appalling, scatological things about Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.51,0:33:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现他  哦不  是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him -- her --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.08,0:33:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实真的很通情达理\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be really... quite reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.77,0:33:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.30,0:33:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔会在眨眼之间出尔反尔然后毁灭你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael will deceive and destroy you at the speed of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.07,0:33:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  对  因为你是正派大好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right, 'cause you're such a straight shooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.71,0:33:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她  他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She -- he --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.18,0:33:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会保护我免受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}has offered me protection against all comers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.38,0:33:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用什么做交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.99,0:34:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炼狱之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purgatory blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.94,0:34:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  你真认为我会让你打开那道门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, you really think I would let you open that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.78,0:34:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你吸收那么多能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}take in that much power?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.47,0:34:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我  才能成为新的上帝  \N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone is going to be the new god, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.04,0:34:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会开启天启  甚至更糟的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna bring the apocalypse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.65,0:34:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这正是你的杰作  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is your doing, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.18,0:34:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过选择了对自己最有利的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm merely grabbing the best offer on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.84,0:34:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你有两条路可走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you have two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.98,0:34:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么滚蛋  要么死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flee or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:35:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.27,0:35:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.80,0:35:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.87,0:35:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  我们必须出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.65,0:36:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忙着呢  先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit busy, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.76,0:36:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们稍等片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be with you in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.25,0:36:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.41,0:36:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我的咒语读错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I said it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.92,0:36:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你读得完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.02,0:36:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你还需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you needed was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.19,0:37:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.75,0:37:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说我们一直用的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've been working with...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.07,0:37:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然是狗血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog blood. Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.69,0:37:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥玩够了吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of these games, castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.27,0:37:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把血给我拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.17,0:37:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}game's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.21,0:37:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见他的瓶子都空了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}His jar's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.31,0:37:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  你的仪式进展如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Castiel, how'd your ritual go?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.27,0:37:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看肯定比我们的强吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than ours, I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.38,0:38:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你无法想象的境界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't imagine what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.30,0:38:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成千上万的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all inside me --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.57,0:38:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在统统在我身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}millions upon millions of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.20,0:38:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确有范儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我退出  你们继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exit stage Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.04,0:38:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔  你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what's the matter, Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.33,0:38:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翅膀被人剪断了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody clip your wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.39,0:38:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.30,0:38:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯放那个恶魔走  却不放过你自己的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let the demon go... but not your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.46,0:38:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔对我还有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon I have plans for.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.19,0:38:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.78,0:39:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.74,0:39:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我救了你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.23,0:39:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡的确  谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure did, Cass. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.86,0:39:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怀疑过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doubted me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.62,0:39:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻碍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}fought against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.76,0:39:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但一直以来我才是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was right all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.33,0:39:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你是对的  我们道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Cass, you were. We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.93,0:39:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在先降低你的危险性好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just defuse you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.81,0:39:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.74,0:39:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你体内的能量非常巨大  很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're full of nuke. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.42,0:39:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以在月蚀结束前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So before the eclipse ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.81,0:39:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这些灵魂送回炼狱去\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get them souls back to where they belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不可能  它们现在是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. They belong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.09,0:39:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  它们会侵占你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cass, I-it's scrambling your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.61,0:39:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这事还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.97,0:39:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔还有许多追随者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael had many followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.91,0:39:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们吃点苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}punish them all severely.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.65,0:39:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.17,0:39:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.65,0:40:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们之间曾经有过许多误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know there's a lot of bad water under the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.11,0:40:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们曾经是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were family once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.26,0:40:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿为你而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have died for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.17,0:40:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么几次确实差点为你送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost did a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.91,0:40:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果我们之间亲情尤在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if that means anything to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.22,0:40:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.74,0:40:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了莉莎  本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost Lisa, I've lost Ben,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.59,0:40:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在又失去了萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I've lost Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.41,0:40:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的不想连你也失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me lose you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.96,0:40:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你现在已经不需要这份力量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need this kind of juice anymore, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.50,0:40:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快舍弃那些力量  否则我们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of it before it kills us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.95,0:40:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么说不过是因为我胜利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just saying that because I won...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.45,0:40:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.02,0:40:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们不是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my family, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.34,0:40:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.89,0:41:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  很高兴你醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you made it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.98,0:41:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是天使之刃对我没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the angel blade won't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.44,0:41:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我现在已经不再是天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm not an angel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.21,0:41:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是新的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new god.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.58,0:41:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更优秀更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}A better one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.83,0:41:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们要卑躬屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you will bow down
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.71,0:41:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向你们的主  也就是我  颂扬你们的爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and profess your love unto me, your lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.28,0:41:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我就杀了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or I shall destroy you.
